# {{ProjectTitle}}

Generated with **SERIXA CLI** (`serixa new {{ProjectName}}`).

Preset: `{{Preset}}`

## What you have

A PHP UI app that renders HTML with SERIXA widgets (SSR-first). No router or auth is included — those stay in your app.

## Setup

```bash
composer install
php -S localhost:8000 -t public
```

Open http://localhost:8000

## Next steps

1. Edit `pages/HomePage.php` — change the heading text and refresh.
2. Add a page: `serixa make:page About`
3. Add a component: `serixa make:component HeroCard`
4. Share chrome in `layouts/AppLayout.php` (assets + `ClientRuntime`)

## Structure

| Path | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `public/` | Front controller (`index.php`), CSS, runtime JS |
| `pages/` | Page documents (`*Page::document()`) |
| `components/` | Reusable app widgets |
| `layouts/` | Shared shell (nav, assets) |
| `config/` | App config |
| `resources/` | Source static assets |

