## Notes

- Serve the app from `public/` so `/assets/runtime/serixa.js` resolves.
- Prefer creating projects **outside** a framework clone when using Composer path repositories (nested `vendor` junctions can recurse).
- Login/forms are UI-only unless you add your own session/auth.
